# Build context for the Dockerfile: only what `pnpm install`, `prisma` (migrate and seed) and `next build` need.
# Keep prisma/seed-data/**: the seed reads the post bodies and case study write-ups from its .md files.
.git
.github
node_modules
.next
src/generated
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tests, tooling output and docs the image doesn't use. Every Playwright config goes too (playwright.config.ts and
# playwright.admin-dev.config.ts): they import e2e/, and `next build` type-checks every .ts file in tsconfig's include
# list, so any of them would fail the build without e2e/ beside it.
e2e
playwright*.config.ts
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
scripts
docs
